Ficheros:
- Packages/MIDI/Sources/MIDI/PatternScheduler.swift: propiedad 'mutes'
  (MuteMask?), lectura unica por ventana en advance(), guard dentro del cierre.
- Packages/MIDI/Sources/MIDI/SchedulerThread.swift: la pasa al PatternScheduler.
- Packages/MIDI/Sources/MIDI/Transport.swift: 'public let mutes = MuteMask()',
